.TH FATHOM_CONTEXT 1  "fathom 0.1.0-alpha.1" 
.SH NAME
fathom\-context \- What this repository knows about a path or an episode: the recorded decisions and the open questions (`e6.5`)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfathom context\fR [\fB\-\-root\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fITARGET\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
What this repository knows about a path or an episode: the recorded decisions and the open questions (`e6.5`)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-root\fR \fI<ROOT>\fR [default: .]
The repository to read
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the answer as one JSON line on stdout (`fathom.cli.context/1`)
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR
Include answered and withdrawn notes in the lists, not just the live ones
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fITARGET\fR>
The path or episode to ask about. A path may be a file or a directory fragment
